**develop**
- IMPORTANT: reboot the node after updating to this version before using the new session-independent update jobs
- run CLI updates through session-independent transient systemd jobs #316
- add a unified target/status CLI frontend #309
- separate shared target transport wrappers from existing updater paths #308
- add schema-versioned machine-readable check status output #306
- define optional target inventory and validate target-specific reachability data #305
- use a matching tag-filter helper for remote cluster checks #304
- synchronize USED_BRANCH with explicit branch updates #303
- simplify branch/version handling and cache remote versions for the welcome screen
- remove obsolete beta runtime handling and avoid network calls during SSH/MOTD login
- use exact guest ID matching and restore released #229 behavior #302
- fail LXC/SSH boot readiness after timeout #300
- compare version components numerically #301
- avoid empty VM startup delay in VM check path #299
- preserve user update.conf and provide current update.conf.dist #298
- fix QEMU guest-exec exit-code and output handling #297
- fix duplicate command execution in error handlers #293
- add configurable backup storage in update.conf #269
- wait for QEMU Guest Agent readiness after starting stopped VMs #296
- harden Community-Scripts updates with timeout and error reporting #294
- add per-guest script-only update mode #243

